    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31884" root="غش" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَشَشٌ</span></b>  <i>A turbid drinking-place:</i> (Az, IAmb,
Sgh, TA:) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الكَدِرُ المَشُوبُ</span> in the K is a mistake:
the right explanation of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الغَشَشُ</span> being <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَشْرَبُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الكَدِرُ</span>, which is that given by Az and IAmb and
Sgh. (TA.)

